{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55848","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学道先须有悟由，还如曾鬬快龙舟。\n虽然旧阁闲（《传灯录》作「於」）田地，一度赢求方始休。\n（又见《僧宝传》卷九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}